# SYNOPSIS

```text
protocol todhchai.gpu.device.Device version 1
call capsets() -> [UInt32]
call open(capset: UInt32) throws(GPUError) -> Handle
```

# DESCRIPTION

Protocol `todhchai.gpu.device.Device`, version 1, of library `GPUDeviceIPC`, its messages in the one wire format (wire(6)).

| Method | Kind | Since | Ordinal |
| `capsets` | call | 1 | `0x72a1259454a3831a` |
| `open` | call | 1 | `0x3542ccd4e8f2b225` |

: `capsets`
  The capability sets the device has (Venus is 4).
: `open`
  A context on capset `capset`: its channel, which speaks Context.

